{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Act 9: The Long Simmer, 2005 to 2025",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s10b01",
     "shot": "small_fires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The pattern since 1968 is not one big explosion.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b02",
     "shot": "small_fires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It's a series of smaller ones, each with a different trigger.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:smaller",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b03",
     "shot": "clichy",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In October 2005, two teenagers, Zyed Benna and Bouna Traore,",
     "date": 2005,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b04",
     "shot": "clichy",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "died in an electrical substation in the suburb of Clichy-sous-Bois while hiding from police.",
     "date": 2005,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b05",
     "shot": "riots2005",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Riots spread through poor suburbs for three weeks,",
     "date": 2005,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b06",
     "shot": "riots2005",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "nearly 9,000 vehicles were burned, and the government declared a state of emergency.",
     "date": 2005,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:9,000",
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:emergency.",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b07",
     "shot": "yellow_vests",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In November 2018 came the Yellow Vests, named after the high-visibility vests every French driver must carry.",
     "date": 2018,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:Yellow",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b08",
     "shot": "yellow_vests",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The trigger was a rise in fuel tax.",
     "date": 2018,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "riser",
       "w:rise",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b09",
     "shot": "yellow_vests",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Every Saturday for months, protesters filled roundabouts and city centres.",
     "date": 2018,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b10",
     "shot": "yellow_vests",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The government dropped the tax rise, but the anger was never really about the tax.",
     "date": 2018,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:dropped",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b11",
     "shot": "yellow_vests",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It was about the cost of living and who feels it.",
     "date": 2018,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:cost",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b12",
     "shot": "pensions",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In 2023 the government raised the retirement age from 62 to 64 and pushed",
     "date": 2023,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:64",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b13",
     "shot": "pensions",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "it through without a final vote in the Assembly,",
     "date": 2023,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "hit",
       "w:without",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b14",
     "shot": "pensions",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "using a constitutional tool called Article 49.3.",
     "date": 2023,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:Article",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b15",
     "shot": "pensions",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Millions marched.",
     "date": 2023,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       2,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b16",
     "shot": "nahel",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And in June 2023, a 17-year-old, Nahel, was shot dead by a police officer",
     "date": 2023,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b17",
     "shot": "nahel",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "during a traffic stop in Nanterre, and riots spread across the country for days.",
     "date": 2023,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b18",
     "shot": "wobble",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Then politics itself began to wobble.",
     "date": 2024,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "creak",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b19",
     "shot": "wobble",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "After a snap election in 2024, the Assembly split into three blocs,",
     "date": 2024,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:three",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b20",
     "shot": "wobble",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "none with a majority.",
     "date": 2024,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b21",
     "shot": "wobble",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Governments started falling.",
     "date": 2024,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       14,
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "thud",
       20,
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "thud",
       26,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b22",
     "shot": "pms",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In December 2024, the Prime Minister, Michel Barnier, lost a no-confidence vote.",
     "date": 2024,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:no-confidence",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b23",
     "shot": "pms",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In September 2025, his successor, Francois Bayrou, lost a confidence vote after proposing around",
     "date": 2025,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:lost",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b24",
     "shot": "pms",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "44 billion euros in savings.",
     "date": 2025,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:44",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b25",
     "shot": "pms",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Two days later, a grassroots movement called 'Block Everything' shut down parts of the",
     "date": 2025,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slam",
       "w:Block",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b26",
     "shot": "pms",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "country, and Macron appointed Sebastien Lecornu, his seventh prime minister since taking office in 2017.",
     "date": 2025,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:seventh",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b27",
     "shot": "triggers",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The triggers keep changing: a dorm rule, a fuel tax,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:dorm",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:fuel",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b28",
     "shot": "triggers",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "a retirement age, a police shooting, a budget.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:retirement",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:police",
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:budget.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b29",
     "shot": "far_away",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "But protesters keep describing the same complaint, that decisions are made far away by",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b30",
     "shot": "far_away",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "people who don't feel the cost.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b31",
     "shot": "debt_clock",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And governments keep giving the same answer: that the debt is real,",
     "date": 2025,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b32",
     "shot": "debt_clock",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and that it doesn't wait.",
     "date": 2025,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b33",
     "shot": "autumn",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Which brings us to the autumn of 2026.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    }
   ],
   "mood": "modern"
  }
 ]
}